      "value": "@{64873f159cf028090ce2c2e2|full_name}: In fact I am stuck too. That image meant that the message was in Japanese even though the display language was Korean, but I should have annotated it.\n\nAs I keep saying, the first time you log in with the latest `l-test`, the reply message list for your account is overwritten with the translation of the language you have set up. Thereafter, changing the display language and restarting the game did not cause the account reply message list to be overwritten with the translation in the changed language.",
